== Usage ==
The '''Maddox Badphone''' can be used to call {{NPCSprite|Maddox the Slayer (Rift);Maddox the Slayer}} from anywhere in the [[Rift]]. The player can only view the [[Vampire Slayer]] branch with the Badphone, similarly to [[Maddox the Slayer (Rift)|Maddox]]'s interface.

